<title>USA: Round Rock, Texas, $13 mln yields 5.85 pct in 2021.</title>
<headline>Round Rock, Texas, $13 mln yields 5.85 pct in 2021.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
